  "identity": "Ancient ROOTED mushroom matron, enormous broad cream-and-russet umbrella cap with moss patches, orange shaded gills beneath, drooping wise face in stout pale stalk torso. Two heavy branching root arms and a spread rooted moss base, no walking boots. Patient half-lidded eyes, little frowning mouth, bulky grandmother mass and hanging fern shawl. Very old kindly guardian, no witch costume.",
